Third-party environments under test
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The `envs/` directory builds container images from third-party applications so
they can be benchmarked. Those applications are NOT distributed with this
repository: each environment recipe pulls the upstream image or source at build
time, and each remains under its own licence.

  Odoo Community Edition        LGPL-3.0        https://github.com/odoo/odoo
  osTicket                      GPL-2.0         https://github.com/osTicket/osTicket
  Roundcube Webmail             GPL-3.0         https://github.com/roundcube/roundcubemail
  Akaunting                     GPL-3.0         https://github.com/akaunting/akaunting
  tn5250 (5250 terminal)        GPL-2.0         https://sourceforge.net/projects/tn5250/
  LibreOffice                   MPL-2.0         https://www.libreoffice.org/

